# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# SPA routing needs no rule here. With no top-level 404.html, Pages serves index.html for
# any path that doesn't match a file, and React Router takes over.
#
# Don't add "/*  /index.html  200". Pages always applies _redirects rules, even when a
# file exists, so it would shadow the per-route HTML files (about.html,
# projects/pr-pilot.html, ...) that carry each page's title and link-preview tags.
#
# Add real redirects below, e.g.:
# /cv  /resume.pdf  302
